# Project Context: STT/TTS App with Multi-LLM Analysis

## Project Goal
Building a speech-to-text/text-to-speech application by synthesizing proposals from multiple LLMs (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Grok, Perplexity).

## Analysis Priorities
1. Compare architectural approaches across all LLM proposals
2. Identify best practices from each proposal
3. Flag conflicting recommendations
4. Synthesize hybrid solutions that combine strengths
5. Prioritize: Performance > Maintainability > Feature richness

## When Reading Proposals
- Look for patterns across multiple LLMs
- Note unique innovations from individual LLMs
- Identify technical trade-offs
- Consider implementation complexity
- Evaluate scalability implications

## Code Review Standards
- Prefer solutions recommended by 3+ LLMs
- Flag single-source recommendations for review
- Prioritize production-ready over experimental code
- Consider cross-platform compatibility (iOS/Android)

## Technology Stack Preferences
- React Native or Flutter for mobile
- Modern STT/TTS APIs (Whisper, Google Cloud, Azure)
- Efficient state management
- Offline capability considerations